{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Logic Bombs</i> is a logic puzzle game where you use deductive reasoning to tackle 160 puzzles about bombs. The same core rules apply to every puzzle so prepare to delve deeper into a realm of pure logic where your understanding will be put to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's simple. It's complicated. It's always logical.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A Mellow Introduction</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial puzzles introduce the rules one by one. Learn by playing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A Merciless Conclusion</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the complexity inherent to a logical system. Learn by playing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>No Nonsense</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no secrets, meta puzzles or other distractions. Focus on what's logical.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>No Hindrance</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle has its own save slot. Do what you can, when you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Logic ROM</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Game Boy compatible ROM file is included in the installation folder. Take it with you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816700?t=1753097232","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816700?t=1753097232","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816700/3d4480ba45378159326994143fd134a801bad3d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753097232","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816700/3d4480ba45378159326994143fd134a801bad3d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753097232","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":